    {
        "text": "December 28th, 5:00 P.M."
    },
    {
        "text": "Zwillingst\u00fcrme, in front of the Twin Empresses' Spires"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
            "volume": 0.8
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m",
            "duration": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael, holding a tuba that's too heavy for him, leads his band to follow the attendant who receives them to the Twin Spires."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "Herr Michael, when you left Lupukarn, the preparations for the New Year celebration should already have been underway, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "And just call me Michael."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "Very well then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "I really miss that town. The sunset might not be as brilliant as the one in Zwillingst\u00fcrme, but the smell of freshly baked crullers... There's nothing better."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "I didn't expect you to arrive so soon. I thought..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "I thought you'd at least spend the New Year in your own spire."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "True, this might have been my last chance to spend one back in Lupukarn. All the heirs sent to Zwillingst\u00fcrme to 'study'\u2014who knows when we'll be able to go back home?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "But it was my own decision to rush here for the New Year celebration."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "You wanted to take part in the festivities?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I plan to submit my application to the Kaiserinnen during my audience today. As Father advised, to ensure equal trade for Lupukarn, we must first seek Their Majesties' approval."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "But Their Majesties... Ah, Michael, I'm not allowed to go any further. I've never been inside, but the Spire of Grace should be over that way."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#10$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "You've never been inside? Then who has been delivering all the official documents from Lupukarn to Their Majesties over the past few years?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "*sigh* When Their Majesties don't want to listen, very few 'noises' reach their ears. The neighboring nobles are well aware of this."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "Anyway, you must be extremely careful when speaking with them. I've heard bad things."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "Especially concerning Grimmacht\u2014she's the one who nearly flattened our town. I've heard that if anyone misspeaks, even a single word, she'll slice them in two with her sword!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "Do not take this lightly! Try to limit your conversation to Her Majesty Ewigegnade, who is kinder and gentler. After all, your safety is what matters most."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Don't worry. I've been preparing for this meeting for a whole year. I shan't be foolish."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "From my self-introduction, to the music arrangements, to every last word in my New Year celebration application, I've already worn out several pens just writing it all down."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4109_baslin_1#8$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Besides, for the first time, a wolf from Lupukarn is being allowed to step into the sheep's Spire. Isn't this a sign of progress?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_271_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Receiving Attendant",
        "text": "...I wish you the best of luck, Michael."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael steps onto the unfamiliar and overly wide path."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "(Breathe, breathe!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
            "volume": 0.8
        }
    },
